{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/9ae629892bd2d492a38a96cb3529b9f9.avif?t=1771010071\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras_big/9ae629892bd2d492a38a96cb3529b9f9.avif?t=1771010071 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tWelcome to Werewolves Revenge, a\u00a0<strong>first person social deduction game</strong>\u00a0with over <strong>200 powerful roles</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/5837029795cf0b0d4f22bd2753ec1536.avif?t=1771010071\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras_big/5837029795cf0b0d4f22bd2753ec1536.avif?t=1771010071 width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/f8c1f44289ab380f4480ca7ba618ffb0.webp?t=1771010071\" width=592 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tUncover hidden roles and objectives through <strong>bluffing</strong>, <strong>strategic questioning</strong>, and <strong>keen observation</strong>. As the Town, vanquish all werewolves before it's too late. As the Werewolves, hunt down and\u00a0meticulously kill the villagers one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/d8d2eaf43adbd2b921912379b7fd3f06.avif?t=1771010071\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a